{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjmcPyUJ3bzxJviP8v5g","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01TGyYBKBE7HXKtDaLb2boZL","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='src/game/director.js'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"  fixed(dt) {\n    try { this._fixed(dt); } catch (e) { this.fatal(e); }\n    this.input.endTick();\n  }\"\"\",\"\"\"  fixed(dt) {\n    // Hit-stop holds everything, input included, so a press during it still counts afterwards.\n    if (this.stopT > 0 && !this.paused) { this.stopT -= dt; return; }\n    try { this._fixed(dt); } catch (e) { this.fatal(e); }\n    this.input.endTick();\n  }\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"    if (this.stopT > 0) { this.stopT -= dt; return; }\n    this.simTime += dt;\"\"\",\"\"\"    this.simTime += dt;\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ncat >> notes/issues.md <<'EOF'\n1. Hit-stop on a catch swallowed pad edges: a Hop pressed in those 12 ms never banked (bot held full hats until it fell). Fixed: hit-stop holds input polling too.\n2. Fruit flight had linear damping, so fruit landed 15 cm short of its shadow ring. Fixed: no damping, aim at basket height.\nEOF\nnode tools/build.mjs && node tools/scratch/fruit.mjs 2>&1 | tail -7","description":"Fix hit-stop input loss and re-measure Fruit Hat","timeout":200000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2655,"cache_read_input_tokens":343498,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2655},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6048a4b4-78b7-4200-a8b0-b745f5bb937e","uuid":"2ad53274-f681-40d2-8f98-3fc7d93b4426","timestamp":"2026-11-05T12:20:11.674Z","request_id":"req_011CgjmcPgrDmx1VzX