{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjtcFdjaMU5pZXk4naoB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The hand-ins check out against `STAGE.md` and `TASK.md`: 20 of 20 direct checks passed, on the same final build as the test results (checksum `4215b27c33898065`).\n\n**Verification on that build**\n- `node tools/test.mjs full` gave **1666 passed, 0 failed**. In `tools/test.mjs`, `full` means all eight groups: `unit`, `flow`, `events`, `balance`, `input`, `audio`, `hub`, `ui`.\n- The hub harness then ran again by itself and passed 9 of 9.\n- I didn't run the suite again after this check, because no code has changed since and TASK.md says to rerun only after changes.\n\n**Handed in, in `work/`**\n- `WeFib-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-044442.html`: the single-file game, 3.87 MB, with no external scripts or stylesheets.\n- `exit-interview.json`: exact shape, every value filled in, with `usage` reading `added on import`.\n- `WeFib-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-044442/`: the dev folder, 91 source modules.\n- `PROGRESS.md`, as `STAGE.md` asks.\n\n**Still can't be done on this computer:** nobody has tried it with a real controller, on a real TV or with human ears, and no person has played it. TASK.md allows stand-ins for these, and those stand-ins are what I tested with. Whether it's fun is still unproven.\n\nThe Source Information and the Testing, Engine and Prompt Feedback in my previous message are the final versions. They match `exit-interview.json`, and the `ui` tests confirm the About screen shows the same answers."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3996,"cache_read_input_tokens":779108,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3996},"output_tokens":574,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnost