{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgk18u2K5gQrBZAG1X9Vy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Final result: `node tools/test.mjs full` gives 2035 passed, 0 failed, in one clean run on the final file.** The checksum was `0c248c52e7eecd04` before and after, and no browser crashed.\n\n| Group | Passed | Failed |\n|---|---|---|\n| `unit` | 1272 | 0 |\n| `flow` (includes the whole-game playthrough) | 57 | 0 |\n| `events` | 286 | 0 |\n| `balance` | 124 | 0 |\n| `input` | 44 | 0 |\n| `audio` | 175 | 0 |\n| `hub` | 9 | 0 |\n| `ui` | 68 | 0 |\n\n**Goal status:** everything in `PLAN.md` that can be checked on this computer is built and passing on this file, and the hand-ins `TASK.md` asks for are in the folder.\n\n**What no test can settle here**\n- **Real hardware and people:** nobody has tried it with a real controller, on a real TV or with human ears, and no person has played it. `TASK.md` calls these \"never required\", and I used its stand-ins.\n- **My judgement calls:** whether it's fun, plus originality, art and tone. The plan leaves these to my judgement, and I based them on screenshots of the final visuals. That's not the same as a person playing it.\n- **Still Water on keys and mouse:** the clumsy bot scores only 12–16. It's the weakest result, close to what the plan measured for a clumsy player on keys and stick. I left the tuning alone, so it's the first thing to watch when someone plays.\n\n**Final answers:** one value changed from my earlier report: the Testing field now says \"about 2,035 checks\". All the other Source Information and feedback answers stand as in that report, and `exit-interview.json` and the About screen match them.\n\nEverything is in `work/`, and nothing is committed to git:\n- `WeFib-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-044442.html`\n- `exit-interview.json`\n- `PROGRESS.md`\n- `WeFib-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-044442/` (dev files; the issue log is `notes/issues.md`)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1101,"cache_read_input_tokens":948333,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1101},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6048a4b4-78b7-4200-a8b0-b745f5bb937e","uuid":"3a34da69-451c-496f-9843-f2bd47604e54","timestamp":"2026-11-05T15:17:20.616Z","request_id":"req_011Cgk18tWK6soMkqkxPDUxL"}
