{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgk1XL5ogJVBFvju2eDfp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011fJ7qQhh3WzpQ8ojhtZmoD","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"echo '--- springboard plan'; sed -n 320,328p ../PLAN.md | cut -c1-560; echo '--- each slider: where it is read'; node -e \"\nconst fs=require('fs'),path=require('path');\nconst walk=d=>fs.readdirSync(d).flatMap(f=>{const p=path.join(d,f);return fs.statSync(p).isDirectory()?walk(p):[p]});\nconst files=walk('src').filter(f=>f.endsWith('.js')&&!/data\\/tuning|core\\/tuning/.test(f));\nconst t=fs.readFileSync('src/data/tuning.js','utf8');\nconst keys=[...t.matchAll(/^\\s+(\\w+): \\{ group/gm)].map(m=>m[1]);\nfor(const k of keys){const hits=[];for(const f of files){fs.readFileSync(f,'utf8').split('\\n').forEach((l,i)=>{if(new RegExp('tun\\\\\\\\.'+k+'\\\\\\\\b|rel\\\\\\\\([\\\\'\\\"]'+k+'[\\\\'\\\"]\\\\\\\\)').test(l))hits.push(f.replace('src/','')+':'+(i+1)+' '+l.trim().slice(0,84))})}\nconsole.log((hits.length?'    ':'NONE')+' '+k+(hits.length?'':''));hits.forEach(h=>console.log('       '+h))}\n\"; echo '--- dev mode screen'; grep -nE \"tun\\[|slider|resetTuning|onChange|TUNING\" src/game/devmode.js | cut -c1-150 | head -24; echo '--- balancer step'; sed -n 55,72p src/physics/balancer.js | cut -c1-140; echo '--- other dev slider tests'; grep -nE \"dev|Dev\" tools/test-ui.mjs tools/test-input.mjs | cut -c1-150 | head -12","description":"Trace every Dev Mode slider to its read sites"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6202,"cache_read_input_tokens":49189,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6202},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6048a4b4-78b7-4200-a8b0-b745f5bb937e","uuid":"059036f9-cc43-4dce-ade4-4d8420294124","timestamp":"2026-11-05T15:22:34.480Z","request_id":"req_011Cgk1XKjiz2JZU2UQiK5jx","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_011fJ7qQhh3WzpQ8ojhtZmoD":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-044442__x29b4d9/work/WeFib-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-044442 && echo '--- springboard plan'; sed -n 320,328p ../PLAN.md | cut -c1-560; echo '--- each slider: where it is read'; node -e \"\nconst fs=require('fs'),path=require('path');\nconst walk=d=>fs.readdirSync(d).flatMap(f=>{const p=path.join(d,f);return fs.statSync(p).isDirectory()?walk(p):[p]});\nconst files=walk('src').filter(f=>f.endsWith('.js')&&!/data\\/tuning|core\\/tuning/.test(f));\nconst t=fs.readFileSync('src/data/tuning.js','utf8');\nconst keys=[...t.matchAll(/^\\s+(\\w+): \\{ group/gm)].map(m=>m[1]);\nfor(const k of keys){const hits=[];for(const f of files){fs.readFileSync(f,'utf8').split('\\n').forEach((l,i)=>{if(new RegExp('tun\\\\\\\\.'+k+'\\\\\\\\b|rel\\\\\\\\([\\\\'\\\"]'+k+'[\\\\'\\\"]\\\\\\\\)').test(l))hits.push(f.replace('src/','')+':'+(i+1)+' '+l.trim().slice(0,84))})}\nconsole.log((hits.length?'    ':'NONE')+' '+k+(hits.length?'':''));hits.forEach(h=>console.log('       '+h))}\n\"; echo '--- dev mode screen'; grep -nE \"tun\\[|slider|resetTuning|onChange|TUNING\" src/game/devmode.js | cut -c1-150 | head -24; echo '--- balancer step'; sed -n 55,72p src/physics/balancer.js | cut -c1-140; echo '--- other dev slider tests'; grep -nE \"dev|Dev\" tools/test-ui.mjs tools/test-input.mjs | cut -c1-150 | head -12","description":"Trace every Dev Mode slider to its read sites"}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_011fJ7qQhh3WzpQ8ojhtZmoD":{"cwd":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-044442__x29b4d9/work/WeFib-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-044442"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011fJ7qQhh3WzpQ8ojhtZmoD","type":"tool_result","content":"--- springboard plan\n**Springboard** (the toy-block dive tower at the end of the pier; side camera, slow-mo side replay)\n- *Play:* Pump the board by squeezing both feet as it goes down. Press Hop near the top to launch. In the air the stick rotates you, holding Hop tucks and spins you faster. Hit the water. **Two ways to win:** a clean entry (head or feet down within 12°) makes barely a ripple and earns Grace. A perfect belly flop (front flat within 20°) sends up a giant column of water, knocks Gary out of the sky, and earns Splash. Score is the better of the two times height. Anything else is \"Technically a Dive.\"\n- *Board ✔:* an analytic spring, not Rapier: `y'' = −ω²y − 2ζωy' − (pumping ? 8 : 0)`, with ω = 2π / .9 s, ζ = .035, starting from a small bounce. Upward speed after 3 / 5 / 7 s of pumping: 4.7 / 6.5 / 7.6 m/s with good timing, 3.6 / 4.6 / 5.2 a little late. A quarter period late (.26 s), it barely moves (1.5 m/s). Pumping by reaction doesn't work, so give it a visible rhythm and a click. Launch speed = `max(3, upward speed at the press)`, so nobody is stuck.\n- *Air ✔:* air time 1.5 s from a 5 m tower at 4 m/s, 2 s at 7 m/s, 2.3 s from 9 m at 7 m/s. The stick sets a target spin up to 3.4 rad/s (195°/s), reached at 9 /s; tuck multiplies it by 1.8. Free the balance core in the air: remove the joint and apply this as torque. Hit chance if you stop by eye with a timing error of 80 / 150 / 250 ms: Grace 56% / 32% / 19% at full stick, 83 / 53 / 33 at half stick, 33 / 18 / 12 tucked; Splash 80 / 51 / 32, 98 / 78 / 53, 52 / 29 / 18. So slow spins are safer, and tucks are for showing off.\n- *Whole run ✔,* pump then launch then a real spinning body, over 40 dives each: launch speed 5.4 / 3.8 / 3 m/s, height from a 5 m tower 6.5 / 5.7 / 5.5 m. Belly flop hit rate 43% / 35% / 13% at full stick, 85 / 68 / 45 at half stick. Head first 35 / 20 / 5 at full stick. **Half stick is too slow to get head first from the 5 m tower** (0% for everyone); it works from 9 m (40 / 0 / 0). Letting go, the spin coasts on for about 22° at full stick, so release early.\n- *Tiers and scoring:* three dives, best two count. Towers 5, 7, 9 m. Grace = `100 × (1 − error / 12°)`, Splash = `100 × (1 − error / 20°)`, each × `(1 + (height − 5) / 10)`.\n- *On entry:* swap to the ragdoll with a simple upward force below y = 0. Keep a 2 s ring buffer of the doll's transform and replay the best flop at ¼ speed.\n- *Bot:* pump in phase, then pick a flop or a dive. Good attract-mode comedy.\n\n--- each slider: where it is read\n     maxLean\n       physics/balancer.js:42 get maxLean() { return this.params.maxLean * rel('maxLean') * RAD; }\n     margin\n       physics/balancer.js:60 const margin = p.margin * rel('margin');\n     zeta\n       physics/balancer.js:61 const zeta = p.zeta * rel('zeta');\n     ankleMax\n       physics/balancer.js:73 const limit = p.ankleMax * rel('ankleMax') * this.diff.ankle * (this.flailLeft > 0 ?\n     fallAngle\n       events/base.js:229 const limit = tun.fallAngle * Math.PI / 180;\n     reflex\n       physics/balancer.js:63 const r = 1 - Math.exp(-p.reflex * rel('reflex') * dt);\n     flailBoost\n       physics/balancer.js:73 const limit = p.ankleMax * rel('ankleMax') * this.diff.ankle * (this.flailLeft > 0 ?\n     flailCooldown\n       physics/balancer.js:49 this.flailLeft = 0.35; this.flailCool = tun.flailCooldown;\n     swayScale\n       physics/balancer.js:76 const t = this.time, ph = this.ph, sway = this.sway * tun.swayScale * this.diff.dist\n     tremorScale\n       physics/balancer.js:77 trem = this.tremor * tun.tremorScale * this.diff.dist * this.breathScale;\n     recoverTime\n       events/base.js:257 lane.fallen = true; lane.falls++; lane.recoverT = tun.recoverTime;\n     gravity\n       events/base.js:160 if (this.worldG !== tun.gravity) { this.worldG = tun.gravity; this.world.gravity = {\n       events/fruitHat.js:90 const T = 1.5, g = tun.gravity;\n       events/springboard.js:190 if (t.y < 0) { body.addForce({ x: 0, y: -t.y * 9 * body.mass() + 1.5 * body.mass() *\n       physics/balancer.js:58 const p = this.params, grav = tun.gravity;\n       physics/island.js:68 const g = tun.gravity;\n       physics/world.js:22 const g = gravity || { x: 0, y: -tun.gravity, z: 0 };\n     islandWeight\n       physics/island.js:64 const W = (K * tun.islandWeight * RAD) / 22 * weight;\n     islandRest\n       game/programme.js:61 if (!p) return tun.islandRest;\n       game/programme.js:62 return p.levelled ? 0 : restTilt(p.stepsDone, this.totalSteps, tun.islandRest);\n     islandSpring\n       physics/island.js:62 const restRad = this.restNow * RAD, K = tun.islandSpring, C = 1.8 * Math.sqrt(K / 2.\n     walkSpeed\n       game/hub.js:347 const s = tun.walkSpeed;\n     fruitMass\n       events/fruitHat.js:92 fruit: { mass: c.mass * tun.fruitMass, value: 1, rad: 0.075 },\n       events/fruitHat.js:93 boot: { mass: c.mass * 1.7 * tun.fruitMass, value: 1, rad: 0.085 },\n       events/fruitHat.js:94 pineapple: { mass: c.mass * 2.6 * tun.fruitMass, value: 5, rad: 0.1 },\n       events/fruitHat.js:295 for (const it of lane.hat) load += it.mass / (this.cfg.mass * tun.fruitMass);\n     fruitInterval\n       events/fruitHat.js:181 this.nextFruit += c.every * tun.fruitInterval;\n     landingRadius\n       events/fruitHat.js:86 const radius = c.radius * tun.landingRadius;\n     stoneMass\n       events/cairn.js:86 this.world.createCollider(RAPIER.ColliderDesc.cuboid(r * 0.8, hh, r * 0.8).setMass(0\n     stoneInterval\n       events/cairn.js:102 this.next = c.every * tun.stoneInterval;\n     ringEnd\n       events/poses.js:74 ringEnd() { return this.cfg.ringEnd * tun.ringEnd; }\n     gustForce\n       events/roomService.js:93 const force = c.gust * tun.gustForce;\n     plateDecay\n       events/plates.js:76 const decay = this.cfg.decay * tun.plateDecay, gain = 0.45 * tun.plateGain;\n     plateGain\n       events/plates.js:76 const decay = this.cfg.decay * tun.plateDecay, gain = 0.45 * tun.plateGain;\n     rhythmWindow\n       events/stepClass.js:119 const k = tun.rhythmWindow * this.diff.rhythm;\n     repTempo\n       events/logReps.js:70 const k = tun.repTempo;\n       events/logReps.js:77 get repLength() { return REP / tun.repTempo; }\n       events/logReps.js:93 lane.depth = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, lane.depth + (both ? 1 : -1) * (dt / (TEMPO.dow\n       events/logReps.js:95 const ribbonDown = this.repT < (TEMPO.down + TEMPO.pause) / tun.repTempo;\n     boardGain\n       events/springboard.js:94 const a = -W * W * lane.boardY - 2 * ZETA * W * lane.boardV - (pumping ? 8 * tun.boa\n     airTorque\n       events/springboard.js:123 const target = i.wishX * 3.4 * tun.airTorque * (tuck ? 1.8 : 1);\n     marblesPerMinute\n       game/programme.js:103 out.marbles = marblesFor(activeSec / 60, m.bonus, firstClear, tun.marblesPerMinute);\n     medalScale\n       game/programme.js:87 const scaled = form / tun.medalScale;\n     hull\n       game/director.js:134 this.inkU.hull.value = tun.hull * k; this.inkU.width.value = tun.lineWidth; this.ink\n     lineWidth\n       game/director.js:134 this.inkU.hull.value = tun.hull * k; this.inkU.width.value = tun.lineWidth; this.ink\n     boil\n       game/director.js:134 this.inkU.hull.value = tun.hull * k; this.inkU.width.value = tun.lineWidth; this.ink\n     grain\n       game/director.js:134 this.inkU.hull.value = tun.hull * k; this.inkU.width.value = tun.lineWidth; this.ink\n--- dev mode screen\n3:import { TUNING } from '../data/tuning.js';\n4:import { tun, resetTuning, tuningJSON } from '../core/tuning.js';\n19:  const groups = Object.keys(TUNING).reduce((a, k) => { (a[TUNING[k].group] = a[TUNING[k].group] || []).push(k); return a; }, {});\n25:    { label: 'Time scale', slider: { min: 0.1, max: 4, step: 0.1, get: () => g.loop.timeScale, set: (v) => { g.loop.timeScale = v; } } },\n45:    { label: 'Palette', choose: PALETTE_ORDER, state: 'palette', fmt: (p) => p, onChange: (p) => g.palette.set(p, 0.5) },\n60:    { label: 'Set Wobble Age', slider: { min: 18, max: 99, step: 1, get: () => (g.save.profile && g.save.profile.today.age) || 60, set: (v) => { co\n67:    { label: 'Reset tuning to defaults', use: () => { resetTuning(); g.applyInk(); renderPage(); g.ui.toast('Back to defaults.'); } },\n73:      page(`${grp} sliders${many ? ` ${n}` : ''}`, keys.slice(i, i + 6).map((k) => {\n74:        const d = TUNING[k];\n75:        return { label: d.label, tune: k, slider: { min: d.min, max: d.max, step: d.step, get: () => tun[k], set: (v) => { tun[k] = v; if (d.group \n103:          if (it.slider) {\n104:            const fmt = (v) => (it.slider.step < 0.01 ? v.toFixed(4) : it.slider.step < 1 ? (+v).toFixed(2) : String(Math.round(v)));\n105:            const el = g.ui.slider(s, it.label, it.slider.get, it.slider.set, { min: it.slider.min, max: it.slider.max, step: it.slider.step, form\n110:            panel.append(g.ui.choice(s, it.label, opts, () => g.devJump[it.state], (v) => { g.devJump[it.state] = v; if (it.onChange) it.onChange(\n--- balancer step\n    if (this.air) { this.body.resetTorques(true); this.extX = 0; this.extZ = 0; return; }\n    this.flailLeft = Math.max(0, this.flailLeft - dt);\n    this.flailCool = Math.max(0, this.flailCool - dt);\n    const p = this.params, grav = tun.gravity;\n    const G = grav * H;\n    const margin = p.margin * rel('margin');\n    const zeta = p.zeta * rel('zeta');\n    const K = G * (1 + margin), wn = Math.sqrt((K - G) / I), D = 2 * zeta * wn * I;\n    const r = 1 - Math.exp(-p.reflex * rel('reflex') * dt);\n    this.wx += (this.wishX - this.wx) * r; this.wz += (this.wishZ - this.wz) * r;\n    const ml = this.maxLean;\n    const tx = this.wx * ml, tz = this.wz * ml;\n    const q = this.body.rotation();\n    const ux = 2 * (q.x * q.y - q.w * q.z), uy = 1 - 2 * (q.x * q.x + q.z * q.z), uz = 2 * (q.y * q.z + q.w * q.x);\n    this.leanX = Math.atan2(ux, uy); this.leanZ = Math.atan2(uz, uy);\n    const w = this.body.angvel();\n    let Tx = -(G * Math.sin(tx) + K * (this.leanX - tx)) + D * w.z;\n    let Tz = -(G * Math.sin(tz) + K * (this.leanZ - tz)) - D * w.x;\n--- other dev slider tests\ntools/test-ui.mjs:4:export default async function ({ ok, launch, logicPage, FILE_URL, root, devices, chromium, webkit, PAD_STUB, EVENT_IDS }) {\ntools/test-ui.mjs:82:  // Pause, How to Play, Dev Mode pages.\ntools/test-ui.mjs:88:  await page.evaluate(() => { const T = window.__TEST__; T.goto('dev'); T.advance(0.05); });\ntools/test-ui.mjs:89:  const devPages = await turnAll('dev');\ntools/test-ui.mjs:90:  ok(devPages >= 8, 'Dev Mode has its pages', String(devPages));\ntools/test-ui.mjs:160:  // Touch-only devices.\ntools/test-ui.mjs:162:  for (const [dev, kind] of profiles) {\ntools/test-ui.mjs:164:    const ctx = await b.newContext({ ...devices[dev] });\ntools/test-ui.mjs:174:    ok(s.touch && s.note && s.settings && s.items === 1, `${dev}: Controller or keyboard required, and Settings`, JSON.stringify\ntools/test-ui.mjs:178:    ok(s2 === 'settings', `${dev}: tap opens Settings`, s2);\ntools/test-ui.mjs:182:    ok(s3, `${dev}: attract runs`);\ntools/test-ui.mjs:185:    ok(!s4.a && s4.n, `${dev}: a tap returns to this screen`, JSON.stringify(s4));","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6048a4b4-78b7-4200-a8b0-b745f5bb937e","uuid":"61dd8a15-4d50-4c92-84e7-04414309cf3a","timestamp":"2026-11-05T15:22:34.929Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"--- springboard plan\n**Springboard** (the toy-block dive tower at the end of the pier; side camera, slow-mo side replay)\n- *Play:* Pump the board by squeezing both feet as it goes down. Press Hop near the top to launch. In the air the stick rotates you, holding Hop tucks and spins you faster. Hit the water. **Two ways to win:** a clean entry (head or feet down within 12°) makes barely a ripple and earns Grace. A perfect belly flop (front flat within 20°) sends up a giant column of water, knocks Gary out of the sky, and earns Splash. Score is the better of the two times height. Anything else is \"Technically a Dive.\"\n- *Board ✔:* an analytic spring, not Rapier: `y'' = −ω²y − 2ζωy' − (pumping ? 8 : 0)`, with ω = 2π / .9 s, ζ = .035, starting from a small bounce. Upward speed after 3 / 5 / 7 s of pumping: 4.7 / 6.5 / 7.6 m/s with good timing, 3.6 / 4.6 / 5.2 a little late. A quarter period late (.26 s), it barely moves (1.5 m/s). Pumping by reaction doesn't work, so give it a visible rhythm and a click. Launch speed = `max(3, upward speed at the press)`, so nobody is stuck.\n- *Air ✔:* air time 1.5 s from a 5 m tower at 4 m/s, 2 s at 7 m/s, 2.3 s from 9 m at 7 m/s. The stick sets a target spin up to 3.4 rad/s (195°/s), reached at 9 /s; tuck multiplies it by 1.8. Free the balance core in the air: remove the joint and apply this as torque. Hit chance if you stop by eye with a timing error of 80 / 150 / 250 ms: Grace 56% / 32% / 19% at full stick, 83 / 53 / 33 at half stick, 33 / 18 / 12 tucked; Splash 80 / 51 / 32, 98 / 78 / 53, 52 / 29 / 18. So slow spins are safer, and tucks are for showing off.\n- *Whole run ✔,* pump then launch then a real spinning body, over 40 dives each: launch speed 5.4 / 3.8 / 3 m/s, height from a 5 m tower 6.5 / 5.7 / 5.5 m. Belly flop hit rate 43% / 35% / 13% at full stick, 85 / 68 / 45 at half stick. Head first 35 / 20 / 5 at full stick. **Half stick is too slow to get head first from the 5 m tower** (0% for everyone); it works from 9 m (40 / 0 / 0). Letting go, the spin coasts on for about 22° at full stick, so release early.\n- *Tiers and scoring:* three dives, best two count. Towers 5, 7, 9 m. Grace = `100 × (1 − error / 12°)`, Splash = `100 × (1 − error / 20°)`, each × `(1 + (height − 5) / 10)`.\n- *On entry:* swap to the ragdoll with a simple upward force below y = 0. Keep a 2 s ring buffer of the doll's transform and replay the best flop at ¼ speed.\n- *Bot:* pump in phase, then pick a flop or a dive. Good attract-mode comedy.\n\n--- each slider: where it is read\n     maxLean\n       physics/balancer.js:42 get maxLean() { return this.params.maxLean * rel('maxLean') * RAD; }\n     margin\n       physics/balancer.js:60 const margin = p.margin * rel('margin');\n     zeta\n       physics/balancer.js:61 const zeta = p.zeta * rel('zeta');\n     ankleMax\n       physics/balancer.js:73 const limit = p.ankleMax * rel('ankleMax') * this.diff.ankle * (this.flailLeft > 0 ?\n     fallAngle\n       events/base.js:229 const limit = tun.fallAngle * Math.PI / 180;\n     reflex\n       physics/balancer.js:63 const r = 1 - Math.exp(-p.reflex * rel('reflex') * dt);\n     flailBoost\n       physics/balancer.js:73 const limit = p.ankleMax * rel('ankleMax') * this.diff.ankle * (this.flailLeft > 0 ?\n     flailCooldown\n       physics/balancer.js:49 this.flailLeft = 0.35; this.flailCool = tun.flailCooldown;\n     swayScale\n       physics/balancer.js:76 const t = this.time, ph = this.ph, sway = this.sway * tun.swayScale * this.diff.dist\n     tremorScale\n       physics/balancer.js:77 trem = this.tremor * tun.tremorScale * this.diff.dist * this.breathScale;\n     recoverTime\n       events/base.js:257 lane.fallen = true; lane.falls++; lane.recoverT = tun.recoverTime;\n     gravity\n       events/base.js:160 if (this.worldG !== tun.gravity) { this.worldG = tun.gravity; this.world.gravity = {\n       events/fruitHat.js:90 const T = 1.5, g = tun.gravity;\n       events/springboard.js:190 if (t.y < 0) { body.addForce({ x: 0, y: -t.y * 9 * body.mass() + 1.5 * body.mass() *\n       physics/balancer.js:58 const p = this.params, grav = tun.gravity;\n       physics/island.js:68 const g = tun.gravity;\n       physics/world.js:22 const g = gravity || { x: 0, y: -tun.gravity, z: 0 };\n     islandWeight\n       physics/island.js:64 const W = (K * tun.islandWeight * RAD) / 22 * weight;\n     islandRest\n       game/programme.js:61 if (!p) return tun.islandRest;\n       game/programme.js:62 return p.levelled ? 0 : restTilt(p.stepsDone, this.totalSteps, tun.islandRest);\n     islandSpring\n       physics/island.js:62 const restRad = this.restNow * RAD, K = tun.islandSpring, C = 1.8 * Math.sqrt(K / 2.\n     walkSpeed\n       game/hub.js:347 const s = tun.walkSpeed;\n     fruitMass\n       events/fruitHat.js:92 fruit: { mass: c.mass * tun.fruitMass, value: 1, rad: 0.075 },\n       events/fruitHat.js:93 boot: { mass: c.mass * 1.7 * tun.fruitMass, value: 1, rad: 0.085 },\n       events/fruitHat.js:94 pineapple: { mass: c.mass * 2.6 * tun.fruitMass, value: 5, rad: 0.1 },\n       events/fruitHat.js:295 for (const it of lane.hat) load += it.mass / (this.cfg.mass * tun.fruitMass);\n     fruitInterval\n       events/fruitHat.js:181 this.nextFruit += c.every * tun.fruitInterval;\n     landingRadius\n       events/fruitHat.js:86 const radius = c.radius * tun.landingRadius;\n     stoneMass\n       events/cairn.js:86 this.world.createCollider(RAPIER.ColliderDesc.cuboid(r * 0.8, hh, r * 0.8).setMass(0\n     stoneInterval\n       events/cairn.js:102 this.next = c.every * tun.stoneInterval;\n     ringEnd\n       events/poses.js:74 ringEnd() { return this.cfg.ringEnd * tun.ringEnd; }\n     gustForce\n       events/roomService.js:93 const force = c.gust * tun.gustForce;\n     plateDecay\n       events/plates.js:76 const decay = this.cfg.decay * tun.plateDecay, gain = 0.45 * tun.plateGain;\n     plateGain\n       events/plates.js:76 const decay = this.cfg.decay * tun.plateDecay, gain = 0.45 * tun.plateGain;\n     rhythmWindow\n       events/stepClass.js:119 const k = tun.rhythmWindow * this.diff.rhythm;\n     repTempo\n       events/logReps.js:70 const k = tun.repTempo;\n       events/logReps.js:77 get repLength() { return REP / tun.repTempo; }\n       events/logReps.js:93 lane.depth = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, lane.depth + (both ? 1 : -1) * (dt / (TEMPO.dow\n       events/logReps.js:95 const ribbonDown = this.repT < (TEMPO.down + TEMPO.pause) / tun.repTempo;\n     boardGain\n       events/springboard.js:94 const a = -W * W * lane.boardY - 2 * ZETA * W * lane.boardV - (pumping ? 8 * tun.boa\n     airTorque\n       events/springboard.js:123 const target = i.wishX * 3.4 * tun.airTorque * (tuck ? 1.8 : 1);\n     marblesPerMinute\n       game/programme.js:103 out.marbles = marblesFor(activeSec / 60, m.bonus, firstClear, tun.marblesPerMinute);\n     medalScale\n       game/programme.js:87 const scaled = form / tun.medalScale;\n     hull\n       game/director.js:134 this.inkU.hull.value = tun.hull * k; this.inkU.width.value = tun.lineWidth; this.ink\n     lineWidth\n       game/director.js:134 this.inkU.hull.value = tun.hull * k; this.inkU.width.value = tun.lineWidth; this.ink\n     boil\n       game/director.js:134 this.inkU.hull.value = tun.hull * k; this.inkU.width.value = tun.lineWidth; this.ink\n     grain\n       game/director.js:134 this.inkU.hull.value = tun.hull * k; this.inkU.width.value = tun.lineWidth; this.ink\n--- dev mode screen\n3:import { TUNING } from '../data/tuning.js';\n4:import { tun, resetTuning, tuningJSON } from '../core/tuning.js';\n19:  const groups = Object.keys(TUNING).reduce((a, k) => { (a[TUNING[k].group] = a[TUNING[k].group] || []).push(k); return a; }, {});\n25:    { label: 'Time scale', slider: { min: 0.1, max: 4, step: 0.1, get: () => g.loop.timeScale, set: (v) => { g.loop.timeScale = v; } } },\n45:    { label: 'Palette', choose: PALETTE_ORDER, state: 'palette', fmt: (p) => p, onChange: (p) => g.palette.set(p, 0.5) },\n60:    { label: 'Set Wobble Age', slider: { min: 18, max: 99, step: 1, get: () => (g.save.profile && g.save.profile.today.age) || 60, set: (v) => { co\n67:    { label: 'Reset tuning to defaults', use: () => { resetTuning(); g.applyInk(); renderPage(); g.ui.toast('Back to defaults.'); } },\n73:      page(`${grp} sliders${many ? ` ${n}` : ''}`, keys.slice(i, i + 6).map((k) => {\n74:        const d = TUNING[k];\n75:        return { label: d.label, tune: k, slider: { min: d.min, max: d.max, step: d.step, get: () => tun[k], set: (v) => { tun[k] = v; if (d.group \n103:          if (it.slider) {\n104:            const fmt = (v) => (it.slider.step < 0.01 ? v.toFixed(4) : it.slider.step < 1 ? (+v).toFixed(2) : String(Math.round(v)));\n105:            const el = g.ui.slider(s, it.label, it.slider.get, it.slider.set, { min: it.slider.min, max: it.slider.max, step: it.slider.step, form\n110:            panel.append(g.ui.choice(s, it.label, opts, () => g.devJump[it.state], (v) => { g.devJump[it.state] = v; if (it.onChange) it.onChange(\n--- balancer step\n    if (this.air) { this.body.resetTorques(true); this.extX = 0; this.extZ = 0; return; }\n    this.flailLeft = Math.max(0, this.flailLeft - dt);\n    this.flailCool = Math.max(0, this.flailCool - dt);\n    const p = this.params, grav = tun.gravity;\n    const G = grav * H;\n    const margin = p.margin * rel('margin');\n    const zeta = p.zeta * rel('zeta');\n    const K = G * (1 + margin), wn = Math.sqrt((K - G) / I), D = 2 * zeta * wn * I;\n    const r = 1 - Math.exp(-p.reflex * rel('reflex') * dt);\n    this.wx += (this.wishX - this.wx) * r; this.wz += (this.wishZ - this.wz) * r;\n    const ml = this.maxLean;\n    const tx = this.wx * ml, tz = this.wz * ml;\n    const q = this.body.rotation();\n    const ux = 2 * (q.x * q.y - q.w * q.z), uy = 1 - 2 * (q.x * q.x + q.z * q.z), uz = 2 * (q.y * q.z + q.w * q.x);\n    this.leanX = Math.atan2(ux, uy); this.leanZ = Math.atan2(uz, uy);\n    const w = this.body.angvel();\n    let Tx = -(G * Math.sin(tx) + K * (this.leanX - tx)) + D * w.z;\n    let Tz = -(G * Math.sin(tz) + K * (this.leanZ - tz)) - D * w.x;\n--- other dev slider tests\ntools/test-ui.mjs:4:export default async function ({ ok, launch, logicPage, FILE_URL, root, devices, chromium, webkit, PAD_STUB, EVENT_IDS }) {\ntools/test-ui.mjs:82:  // Pause, How to Play, Dev Mode pages.\ntools/test-ui.mjs:88:  await page.evaluate(() => { const T = window.__TEST__; T.goto('dev'); T.advance(0.05); });\ntools/test-