{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgk5aA6LHDg69iAnNyL5Y","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014KvhaBttDComSpmyGNywSc","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"sed -n 133,152p ../PLAN.md | cut -c1-420; echo; echo '--- lane options bots read'; grep -noE \"lane\\.(noBreath|parkStick|bankAt|stickAt|stickMax|lean[A-Z][a-z]+|brace[A-Za-z]*|noBrace|bracing|want[A-Z][a-z]+|neverFlail|[a-z]+At)\\b\" src/events/*.js | awk -F: '{print $1\":\"$3}' | sort -u | sed 's/src.events.//'; echo '--- result fields'; for e in poses cairn stillWater logReps plank tug stepClass plates islandLoop fruitHat roomService raft grandHold; do echo \"== $e\"; awk '/laneResult\\(/{f=1} f{print; c++} c>=9{exit}' src/events/$e.js | cut -c1-170; done","description":"Read balance figures, bot options and result formulas"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":22931,"cache_read_input_tokens":210316,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":22931},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6048a4b4-78b7-4200-a8b0-b745f5bb937e","uuid":"7f74430b-cacb-47c9-9fd2-cadaeb409f58","timestamp":"2026-11-05T16:15:55.131Z","request_id":"req_011Cgk5a9qTsLcVE12rDJVd7","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_014KvhaBttDComSpmyGNywSc":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-044442__x29b4d9/work/WeFib-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-044442 && sed -n 133,152p ../PLAN.md | cut -c1-420; echo; echo '--- lane options bots read'; grep -noE \"lane\\.(noBreath|parkStick|bankAt|stickAt|stickMax|lean[A-Z][a-z]+|brace[A-Za-z]*|noBrace|bracing|want[A-Z][a-z]+|neverFlail|[a-z]+At)\\b\" src/events/*.js | awk -F: '{print $1\":\"$3}' | sort -u | sed 's/src.events.//'; echo '--- result fields'; for e in poses cairn stillWater logReps plank tug stepClass plates islandLoop fruitHat roomService raft grandHold; do echo \"== $e\"; awk '/laneResult\\(/{f=1} f{print; c++} c>=9{exit}' src/events/$e.js | cut -c1-170; done","description":"Read balance figures, bot options and result formulas"}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_014KvhaBttDComSpmyGNywSc":{"cwd":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-044442__x29b4d9/work/WeFib-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-044442"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014KvhaBttDComSpmyGNywSc","type":"tool_result","content":"**Defaults ✔:** `maxLean` 18°, `margin` 0.45, `zeta` 0.40, `ankleMax` 4.6 N·m, `reflex` 10 /s, `flailBoost` 1.9, flail lasts 0.35 s with a 2 s cooldown, fall at 45° of lean.\n\n**What those numbers do ✔:**\n- Full stick from rest reaches 90% in about 1 s, overshoots to about 23° and settles at 18°. It is a soft, wobbly, toy-like feel.\n- Whipping the stick end to end at about 0.5 Hz survives. Slamming it from −18° to +18° peaks near 28° at `ankleMax` 4.2 and up, and falls at 3.8. This is why careful correction matters.\n- The torque limit makes a natural point of no return at `asin(ankleMax / G)`, about 39° with no load. Hat and stone loads lower it automatically.\n\n**Gusts at the defaults ✔ (0.5 s long; these numbers are the difficulty dial):**\n\n| Gust | Do nothing | Flail as you pass about 30° | Stick against it once it has started | Braced: stick at 60% against it, 0.5 s before it hits |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 2 N·m | safe, peaks 22° | | | |\n| 2.5 N·m | safe, peaks 31° | | | |\n| 3 N·m | **falls** | saved, peaks 38° | falls | safe, peaks 19° |\n| 3.5 N·m | falls | saved only if timed near 32°, peaks 43° | falls | safe, peaks 29° |\n| 4 N·m | falls | falls | falls | falls |\n\nSo a telegraph is worth a lot: **give a warning before every gust of 3 N·m or more.** And flail is a real last-moment save with timing in it: a flail used early, before you have moved much, wears off and you still fall. It is the moment people will shout at the TV.\n\n**The load rule ✔.** Every prop adds a gravity moment δ = mass × 9.81 × height. The doll grows unstable when total δ exceeds K − G (3.3 at the default margin). A prop's mass therefore decides how many you can carry. Too heavy and the doll tips over at once: with margin 0.45, 0.06 kg fruit tipped it at the 5th or 6th catch, while 0.015 kg works out to about 13. **Keep prop masses small** (0.01 to 0.03 kg) against the \n\n--- lane options bots read\nfruitHat.js:lane.bankAt\nposes.js:lane.parkStick\nroomService.js:lane.braceK\nstepClass.js:lane.leanScored\n--- result fields\n== poses\n  laneResult(lane) {\n    const form = this.formOf(lane);\n    return { form, raw: lane.earn, big: Math.round(form), stats: `${this.seq.length} poses · ${lane.falls} floor exercises` };\n  }\n}\n== cairn\n  laneResult(lane) {\n    const on = lane.onSlab || 0;\n    let height = 0;\n    if (lane.stones) for (const s of lane.stones) if (s.on) height += s.hh * 2;\n    const steady = lane.steadyN > 0 ? lane.steady / lane.steadyN : 0;\n    const raw = 100 * on + height * 60 + steady * 60;\n    return { form: (100 * raw) / this.cfg.par, raw, big: Math.round(raw), stats: `${on} of ${this.cfg.stones} stones standing · ${lane.falls} floor exercises` };\n  }\n}\n== stillWater\n  laneResult(lane) {\n    const share = this.inT / Math.max(1, Math.min(this.t, this.cfg.time));\n    const form = ((share + this.calm) / 2) * 100;\n    return { form, raw: form, big: Math.round(form), stats: `${Math.round(share * 100)}% in the zone · peak calm ${Math.round(this.peak * 100)}% · ${this.scattered} scatt\n  }\n}\nexport { Gull, h, float, smoothstep };\n== logReps\n  laneResult(lane) {\n    const form = lane.maxScore ? (100 * lane.score) / lane.maxScore : 0;\n    return { form, raw: lane.score, big: Math.round(form), stats: `${lane.repN} reps · ${lane.falls} floor exercises` };\n  }\n}\nexport { THREE, TEAL, CREAM, RED };\n== plank\n  laneResult() {\n    const share = (100 * this.inT) / this.cfg.time;\n    const on = this.gulls.filter((g) => g.landed && !g.leave).length;\n    const raw = share + on * 0.5 - this.flails * 4;\n    return { form: (100 * raw) / this.cfg.par, raw, big: Math.round(raw), stats: `${Math.round(share)}% in the zone · ${on} gulls still on you · ${this.flops} flops` };\n  }\n}\nexport { h, CREAM };\n== tug\n  laneResult(lane) {\n    const won = lane.team === 0 ? this.wins[0] : this.wins[1];\n    const form = Math.max(0, 40 + 30 * won - 5 * lane.falls);\n    return { form, raw: won, big: `${won} won`, stats: `Pulls ${this.wins[0]}-${this.wins[1]} · ${lane.falls} sat down` };\n  }\n}\nexport { DEG };\n== stepClass\n  laneResult(lane) {\n    const form = (100 * (lane.sum || 0)) / Math.max(1, this.max);\n    return { form, raw: lane.sum, big: Math.round(form), stats: `Best combo ${lane.best} · ${lane.perfect} perfect · ${lane.miss} missed` };\n  }\n}\nexport { toon, basic };\n== plates\n  laneResult(lane) {\n    const share = lane.aliveMax ? lane.alive / lane.aliveMax : 0;\n    const form = Math.max(0, 200 * share - 100);\n    return { form, raw: share, big: Math.round(form), stats: `${Math.round(share * 100)}% of plate-time up · ${lane.crashes} smashed` };\n  }\n}\nexport { TEAL, ORANGE };\n== islandLoop\n  laneResult() {\n    const share = this.inBand / Math.max(1, this.time);\n    const raw = share * 100 + this.shells * 0.25;\n    return { form: (100 * raw) / this.cfg.par, raw, big: Math.round(raw), stats: `${Math.round(share * 100)}% at a good pace · ${this.shells} shells · ${this.stumbles} st\n  }\n  dispose() {\n    const g = this.game, lane = this.lanes[0];\n    g.art.group.remove(lane.doll.root); g.art.group.remove(this.kevin.root);\n    for (const s of this.shellList) g.art.group.remove(s.s);\n== fruitHat\n  laneResult(lane) {\n    let unbanked = 0;\n    for (const it of lane.hat) unbanked += it.value;\n    const raw = lane.raw + (unbanked * (1 + 0.1 * (lane.hat.length - 1))) * 0.5;\n    const form = (100 * raw) / this.cfg.par;\n    return { form, raw, big: Math.round(raw), stats: `${lane.banked} banked · best hat ${lane.bigBank} · ${lane.falls} floor exercises` };\n  }\n}\n== roomService\n  laneResult(lane) {\n    const on = lane.tumblers ? lane.tumblers.filter((t) => t.on).length : 0;\n    const delivered = lane.done ? on : Math.floor(on / 2);\n    const par = (this.cfg.length / STEP_LEN) * CADENCE;\n    const bonus = lane.done ? Math.max(0, 40 * (1 - (lane.doneT - par) / (par * 0.5))) : 0;\n    const raw = 100 * delivered + bonus;\n    return { form: (100 * raw) / this.cfg.par, raw, big: `${delivered}/5`, stats: `${lane.done ? 'Delivered' : 'Not delivered'} · ${lane.stumbles} stumbles · ${lane.splas\n  }\n}\n== raft\n  laneResult(lane) {\n    const w = this.wins[lane.id] || 0;\n    const form = 40 + 30 * w;\n    return { form, raw: w, big: `${w} won`, stats: `${w} rounds won of ${this.round}` };\n  }\n}\nfunction ringSeg(a, b, start, len) {\n  const shape = new THREE.Shape();\n  shape.absarc(0, 0, b, start, start + len - 0.02, false);\n== grandHold\n  laneResult() {\n    const share = this.lastIn / Math.max(1, this.lastT);\n    const form = 60 + 40 * share;\n    return { form, raw: form, big: Math.round(form), stats: `${Math.round(share * 100)}% in the last ring · ${this.restarts} caught by the bedsheet` };\n  }\n  dispose() {\n    const g = this.game;\n    g.phys.leanExtraX = 0; g.phys.leanExtraZ = 0;\n    for (const gu of g.art.guests) { gu.wait = 1; gu.doll.rig.loop('idle'); }","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6048a4b4-78b7-4200-a8b0-b745f5bb937e","uuid":"9e4065d1-5f90-4237-a59d-e9048b39c9c0","timestamp":"2026-11-05T16:15:55.241Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"**Defaults ✔:** `maxLean` 18°, `margin` 0.45, `zeta` 0.40, `ankleMax` 4.6 N·m, `reflex` 10 /s, `flailBoost` 1.9, flail lasts 0.35 s with a 2 s cooldown, fall at 45° of lean.\n\n**What those numbers do ✔:**\n- Full stick from rest reaches 90% in about 1 s, overshoots to about 23° and settles at 18°. It is a soft, wobbly, toy-like feel.\n- Whipping the stick end to end at about 0.5 Hz survives. Slamming it from −18° to +18° peaks near 28° at `ankleMax` 4.2 and up, and falls at 3.8. This is why careful correction matters.\n- The torque limit makes a natural point of no return at `asin(ankleMax / G)`, about 39° with no load. Hat and stone loads lower it automatically.\n\n**Gusts at the defaults ✔ (0.5 s long; these numbers are the difficulty dial):**\n\n| Gust | Do nothing | Flail as you pass about 30° | Stick against it once it has started | Braced: stick at 60% against it, 0.5 s before it hits |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 2 N·m | safe, peaks 22° | | | |\n| 2.5 N·m | safe, peaks 31° | | | |\n| 3 N·m | **falls** | saved, peaks 38° | falls | safe, peaks 19° |\n| 3.5 N·m | falls | saved only if timed near 32°, peaks 43° | falls | safe, peaks 29° |\n| 4 N·m | falls | falls | falls | falls |\n\nSo a telegraph is worth a lot: **give a warning before every gust of 3 N·m or more.** And flail is a real last-moment save with timing in it: a flail used early, before you have moved much, wears off and you still fall. It is the moment people will shout at the TV.\n\n**The load rule ✔.** Every prop adds a gravity moment δ = mass × 9.81 × height. The doll grows unstable when total δ exceeds K − G (3.3 at the default margin). A prop's mass therefore decides how many you can carry. Too heavy and the doll tips over at once: with margin 0.45, 0.06 kg fruit tipped it at the 5th or 6th catch, while 0.015 kg works out to about 13. **Keep prop masses small** (0.01 to 0.03 kg) against the \n\n--- lane options bots read\nfruitHat.js:lane.bankAt\nposes.js:lane.parkStick\nroomService.js:lane.braceK\nstepClass.js:lane.leanScored\n--- result fields\n== poses\n  laneResult(lane) {\n    const form = this.formOf(lane);\n    return { form, raw: lane.earn, big: Math.round(form), stats: `${this.seq.length} poses · ${lane.falls} floor exercises` };\n  }\n}\n== cairn\n  laneResult(lane) {\n    const on = lane.onSlab || 0;\n    let height = 0;\n    if (lane.stones) for (const s of lane.stones) if (s.on) height += s.hh * 2;\n    const steady = lane.steadyN > 0 ? lane.steady / lane.steadyN : 0;\n    const raw = 100 * on + height * 60 + steady * 60;\n    return { form: (100 * raw) / this.cfg.par, raw, big: Math.round(raw), stats: `${on} of ${this.cfg.stones} stones standing · ${lane.falls} floor exercises` };\n  }\n}\n== stillWater\n  laneResult(lane) {\n    const share = this.inT / Math.max(1, Math.min(this.t, this.cfg.time));\n    const form = ((share + this.calm) / 2) * 100;\n    return { form, raw: form, big: Math.round(form), stats: `${Math.round(share * 100)}% in the zone · peak calm ${Math.round(this.peak * 100)}% · ${this.scattered} scatt\n  }\n}\nexport { Gull, h, float, smoothstep };\n== logReps\n  laneResult(lane) {\n    const form = lane.maxScore ? (100 * lane.score) / lane.maxScore : 0;\n    return { form, raw: lane.score, big: Math.round(form), stats: `${lane.repN} reps · ${lane.falls} floor exercises` };\n  }\n}\nexport { THREE, TEAL, CREAM, RED };\n== plank\n  laneResult() {\n    const share = (100 * this.inT) / this.cfg.time;\n    const on = this.gulls.filter((g) => g.landed && !g.leave).length;\n    const raw = share + on * 0.5 - this.flails * 4;\n    return { form: (100 * raw) / this.cfg.par, raw, big: Math.round(raw), stats: `${Math.round(share)}% in the zone · ${on} gulls still on you · ${this.flops} flops` };\n  }\n}\nexport { h, CREAM };\n== tug\n  laneResult(lane) {\n    const won = lane.team === 0 ? this.wins[0] : this.wins[1];\n    const form = Math.max(0, 40 + 30 * won - 5 * lane.falls);\n    return { form, raw: won, big: `${won} won`, stats: `Pulls ${this.wins[0]}-${this.wins[1]} · ${lane.falls} sat down` };\n  }\n}\nexport { DEG };\n== stepClass\n  laneResult(lane) {\n    const form = (100 * (lane.sum || 0)) / Math.max(1, this.max);\n    return { form, raw: lane.sum, big: Math.round(form), stats: `Best combo ${lane.best} · ${lane.perfect} perfect · ${lane.miss} missed` };\n  }\n}\nexport { toon, basic };\n== plates\n  laneResult(lane) {\n    const share = lane.aliveMax ? lane.alive / lane.aliveMax : 0;\n    const form = Math.max(0, 200 * share - 100);\n    return { form, raw: share, big: Math.round(form), stats: `${Math.round(share * 100)}% of plate-time up · ${lane.crashes} smashed` };\n  }\n}\nexport { TEAL, ORANGE };\n== islandLoop\n  laneResult() {\n    const share = this.inBand / Math.max(1, this.time);\n    const raw = share * 100 + this.shells * 0.25;\n    return { form: (100 * raw) / this.cfg.par, raw, big: Math.round(raw), stats: `${Math.round(share * 100)}% at a good pace · ${this.shells} shells · ${this.stumbles} st\n  }\n  dispose() {\n    const g = this.game, lane = this.lanes[0];\n    g.art.group.remove(lane.doll.root); g.art.group.remove(this.kevin.root);\n    for (const s of this.shellList) g.art.group.remove(s.s);\n== fruitHat\n  laneResult(lane) {\n    let unbanked = 0;\n    for (const it of lane.hat) unbanked += it.value;\n    const raw = lane.raw + (unbanked * (1 + 0.1 * (lane.hat.length - 1))) * 0.5;\n    const form = (100 * raw) / this.cfg.par;\n    return { form, raw, big: Math.round(raw), stats: `${lane.banked} banked · best hat ${lane.bigBank} · ${lane.falls} floor exercises` };\n  }\n}\n== roomService\n  laneResult(lane) {\n    const on = lane.tumblers ? lane.tumblers.filter((t) => t.on).length : 0;\n    const delivered = lane.done ? on : Math.floor(on / 2);\n    const par = (this.cfg.length / STEP_LEN) * CADENCE;\n    const bonus = lane.done ? Math.max(0, 40 * (1 - (lane.doneT - par) / (par * 0.5))) : 0;\n    const raw = 100 * delivered + bonus;\n    return { form: (100 * raw) / this.cfg.par, raw, big: `${delivered}/5`, stats: `${lane.done ? 'Delivered' : 'Not delivered'} · ${lane.stumbles} stumbles · ${lane.splas\n  }\n}\n== raft\n  laneResult(lane) {\n    const w = this.wins[lane.id] || 0;\n    const form = 40 + 30 * w;\n    return { form, raw: w, big: `${w} won`, stats: `${w} rounds won of ${this.round}` };\n  }\n}\nfunction ringSeg(a, b, start, len) {\n  const shape = new THREE.Shape();\n  shape.absarc(0, 0, b, start, start + len - 0.02, false);\n== grandHold\n  laneResult() {\n    const share = this.lastIn / Math.max(1, this.lastT);\n    const form = 60 + 40 * share;\n    return { form, raw: form, big: Math.round(form), stats: `${Math.round(share * 100)}% in the last ring · ${this.restarts} caught by the bedsheet` };\n  }\n  dispose() {\n    const g = this.game;\n    g.phys.leanExtraX = 0; g.phys.leanExtraZ = 0;\n    for (const gu of g.art.guests) { gu.wait = 1; gu.doll.rig.loop('idle'); }","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_014KvhaBttDComSpmyGNywSc","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgk5aA6LHDg69iAnNyL5Y","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01N4fdmgcbypHAfbkvEC62GQ","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"for e in tug poses cairn roomService plates grandHold; do echo \"== $e botInput\"; awk '/botInput\\(/{f=1} f{print; c++} c>=22{exit}' src/events/$e.js | cut -c1-175; done; echo '--- breath in base'; grep -n \"autoBreathe\\|breathScale\\|syncShare\\|inSync\\|breathe\" src/events/base.js src/physics/balancer.js | cut -c1-140 | head -12; grep -n \"breathe\\|noBreath\" src/input/bot.js | cut -c1-140; echo '--- balancer options per event'; grep -n \"maxLean\\|margin:\\|ankleMax:\\|reflex:\" src/events/*.js | cut -c1-140 | head -24","description":"Read bot inputs and balancer options per event"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":22931,"cache_read_input_tokens":210316,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":22931},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6048a4b4-78b7-4200-a8b0-b745f5bb937e","uuid":"1db346ad-67d6-4ff3-b883-29154bc356d7","timestamp":"2026-11-05T16:15:59.149Z","request_id":"req_011Cgk5a9qTsLcVE12rDJVd7","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01N4fdmgcbypHAfbkvEC62GQ":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-044442__x29b4d9/work/WeFib-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-044442 && for e in tug poses cairn roomService plates grandHold; do echo \"== $e botInput\"; awk '/botInput\\(/{f=1} f{print; c++} c>=22{exit}' src/events/$e.js | cut -c1-175; done; echo '--- breath in base'; grep -n \"autoBreathe\\|breathScale\\|syncShare\\|inSync\\|breathe\" src/events/base.js src/physics/balancer.js | cut -c1-140 | head -12; grep -n \"breathe\\|noBreath\" src/input/bot.js | cut -c1-140; echo '--- balancer options per event'; grep -n \"maxLean\\|margin:\\|ankleMax:\\|reflex:\" src/events/*.js | cut -c1-140 | head -24","description":"Read bot inputs and balancer options per event"}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_01N4fdmgcbypHAfbkvEC62GQ":{"cwd":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261105-044442__x29b4d9/work/WeFib-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261105-044442"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01N4fdmgcbypHAfbkvEC62GQ","type":"tool_result","content":"== tug botInput\n  botInput(lane, t, bot) {\n    const out = lane.input;\n    const stick = lane.tugStick ?? 0.9;\n    const [x, z] = bot.steer(0, stick, true);\n    out.wishX = x * 0.3; out.wishZ = Math.max(z, stick);\n    const dueIn = this.next + bot.timingOff;\n    bot.timingOff = bot.timingOff ?? bot.timing();\n    const press = this.next <= Math.max(0, 0.04 + (bot.data.err ?? 0));\n    if (this.next > 1) bot.data.err = bot.timing();\n    const v = press || (this.callT !== undefined && this.t - this.callT < 0.12) ? 1 : 0;\n    out.footL = v; out.footR = v;\n    out.flail = !lane.fallen && lane.bal.lean > 0.52 && lane.bal.flailCool <= 0;\n    return dueIn;\n  }\n  hud() {\n    const hud = this.game.hud;\n    hud.setScore(`${this.wins[0]}-${this.wins[1]}`, 'Pulls');\n    hud.setTime(null);\n    if (this.ropeBar) this.ropeBar.set((this.rope + 1) / 2);\n    if (this.scoreTag) { const s = `Pull ${Math.min(3, this.pull)} of 3`; if (this.scoreTag.textContent !== s) this.scoreTag.textContent = s; }\n  }\n  placeDoll(d, x, faceRight, leanBack, y = 0) {\n== poses botInput\n  botInput(lane, t, bot) {\n    const out = lane.input;\n    const gx = this.ring.x, gz = this.ring.z;\n    if (lane.parkStick) { out.wishX = gx; out.wishZ = gz; } else {\n      const [x, z] = bot.steer(gx, gz);\n      out.wishX = x; out.wishZ = z;\n    }\n    out.breathe = bot.breathe(lane);\n    out.flail = !lane.fallen && lane.bal.lean > 0.55 && lane.bal.flailCool <= 0;\n  }\n  hud() {\n    const me = this.lanes.find((l) => l.kind === 'local') || this.lanes[0];\n    const hud = this.game.hud;\n    hud.setTime(Math.max(0, this.total - this.t));\n    hud.setScore(Math.round(this.formOf(me)), 'Form');\n    for (const lane of this.lanes) lane.discView.zone = this.stage === 'finished' ? null : { x: this.ring.x, z: this.ring.z, r: this.ring.r, on: lane.inRing };\n  }\n  formOf(lane) { return this.maxEarn > 0 ? Math.min(100, (100 * lane.earn) / this.maxEarn) : 0; }\n  frameEvent(dt) { if (this.heron) this.heron.update(dt); }\n  isDone() { return this.stage === 'finished'; }\n  laneResult(lane) {\n    const form = this.formOf(lane);\n== cairn botInput\n  botInput(lane, t, bot) {\n    const out = lane.input;\n    const [x, z] = bot.steer(0, 0, true);\n    out.wishX = x; out.wishZ = z;\n    out.breathe = bot.breathe(lane);\n    out.flail = !lane.fallen && lane.bal.lean > 0.55 && lane.bal.flailCool <= 0;\n  }\n  hud() {\n    const me = this.lanes.find((l) => l.kind === 'local') || this.lanes[0];\n    const hud = this.game.hud;\n    hud.setScore(`${me.onSlab || 0}/${this.cfg.stones}`, 'Stones');\n    hud.setTime(Math.max(0, this.total - this.t));\n    for (const lane of this.lanes) lane.discView.zone = { x: 0, z: 0, r: 0.3, on: Math.hypot(lane.dotX, lane.dotZ) < 0.3 };\n  }\n  frameEvent(dt) {\n    for (const lane of this.lanes) {\n      if (!lane.stones) continue;\n      for (const s of lane.stones) {\n        const p = s.body.translation(), q = s.body.rotation();\n        s.mesh.position.set(p.x, p.y, p.z); s.mesh.quaternion.set(q.x, q.y, q.z, q.w);\n      }\n    }\n== roomService botInput\n  botInput(lane, t, bot) {\n    const out = lane.input;\n    const d = bot.data;\n    d.next = (d.next ?? 0.2) - 1 / 120;\n    out.footLPressed = false; out.footRPressed = false; out.footL = 0; out.footR = 0;\n    if (d.next <= 0 && !lane.done && !lane.fallen) {\n      d.next = CADENCE * (1 + (bot.r() - 0.5) * bot.s.timing * 3);\n      d.foot = d.foot === 'L' ? 'R' : 'L';\n      if (d.foot === 'L') { out.footLPressed = true; out.footL = 1; } else { out.footRPressed = true; out.footR = 1; }\n    }\n    // Keep centred; brace at .2 × gust on the telegraph.\n    let gx = -lane.side * 0.5, gz = 0;\n    const brace = lane.braceK ?? 0.2;\n    if (this.gust && this.gust.warn < 1 - bot.s.lag * 0.5) gx += -Math.sign(this.gust.x) * brace * Math.abs(this.gust.x);\n    const [x, z] = bot.steer(gx, gz, true);\n    out.wishX = x; out.wishZ = z;\n    out.flail = !lane.fallen && lane.bal.lean > 0.6 && lane.bal.flailCool <= 0;\n  }\n  hud() {\n    const me = this.lanes.find((l) => l.kind === 'local') || this.lanes[0];\n    const hud = this.game.hud;\n    const on = me.tumblers ? me.tumblers.filter((t) => t.on).length : 0;\n== plates botInput\n  botInput(lane, t, bot) {\n    const out = lane.input;\n    // Pick the band of the lowest plate; rotate at the band's middle, with reaction time and speed error.\n    let low = null;\n    for (const p of lane.plates) if (p.state === 'on' && (!low || p.energy < low.energy)) low = p;\n    const d = bot.data;\n    d.react = (d.react || 0) - 1 / 120;\n    if (d.react <= 0) {\n      d.react = bot.s.lag + 0.25;\n      // Stay on a plate until it is healthy, unless another is nearly gone.\n      const cur = d.plate && d.plate.state === 'on' ? d.plate : null;\n      const keep = cur && cur.energy < 0.92 && !(low && low !== cur && low.energy < 0.22 && cur.energy > 0.35);\n      if (!keep) d.plate = low;\n      const b = d.plate ? d.plate.band : BANDS.M;\n      if (d.band !== b) { d.band = b; d.err = (bot.r() - 0.5) * 2 * bot.s.speedErr * 0.6; }\n      d.want = (b.lo + b.hi) / 2 + (d.err || 0);\n    }\n    // A hand on a stick: the rate wanders, and now and then the circle slips inward.\n    const wander = { sharp: 0.02, average: 0.08, clumsy: 0.13 }[bot.skillName] ?? 0.08;\n    d.ang = (d.ang || 0) + (d.want || 0) * (1 + Math.sin(bot.t * 1.3 + bot.ph) * wander) * (1 / 120);\n    const slipEvery = { sharp: 30, average: 7, clumsy: 3.6 }[bot.skillName] ?? 7;\n    d.slip = (d.slip || 0) - 1 / 120;\n== grandHold botInput\n  botInput(lane, t, bot) {\n    const out = lane.input;\n    let gx = 0, gz = 0;\n    if (this.ring) { gx = this.ring.x; gz = this.ring.z; }\n    if (this.gust && this.gust.warn > 0 && this.gust.warn < 1) { const f = 0.2; gx += (-this.gust.x / 3) * f * 3; gz += (-this.gust.z / 3) * f * 3; }\n    const [x, z] = bot.steer(gx, gz, this.stage === 'stones');\n    out.wishX = x; out.wishZ = z;\n    out.breathe = bot.breathe(lane);\n    out.flail = !lane.fallen && lane.bal.lean > 0.56 && lane.bal.flailCool <= 0;\n  }\n  hud() {\n    const lane = this.lanes[0], hud = this.game.hud;\n    const totals = { pose: 20, stones: 20, storm: 20, step: 20, last: 15 };\n    hud.setTime(Math.max(0, totals[this.stage] - this.stageT));\n    lane.discView.zone = this.ring ? { x: this.ring.x, z: this.ring.z, r: this.ring.r, on: this.nowIn } : null;\n  }\n  frameEvent(dt) {\n    const g = this.game;\n    g.syncIsland(dt);\n    this.cameraShot(false);\n    for (const s of this.stones) { const p = s.body.translation(), q = s.body.rotation(); s.mesh.position.set(p.x, p.y, p.z); s.mesh.quaternion.set(q.x, q.y, q.z, q.w); }\n    this.gary.update(dt);\n--- breath in base\nsrc/physics/balancer.js:34:    this.breathScale = 1;\nsrc/physics/balancer.js:76:    const t = this.time, ph = this.ph, sway = this.sway * tun.swayScale * this.diff.dist * this.breathScale,\nsrc/physics/balancer.js:77:      trem = this.tremor * tun.tremorScale * this.diff.dist * this.breathScale;\nsrc/events/base.js:30:  constructor() { this.t = 0; this.samples = []; this.inSync = false; this.syncShare = 0; this.period = 8; }\nsrc/events/base.js:44:        this.syncShare = s / this.samples.length;\nsrc/events/base.js:45:        this.inSync = this.syncShare >= 0.7;\nsrc/events/base.js:47:    } else if (auto) this.inSync = true;\nsrc/events/base.js:207:      lane.breath.step(dt, !!i.breathe, this.game.save.settings.autoBreathe || lane.breathAuto);\nsrc/events/base.js:209:      b.breathScale = lane.breath.inSync ? 0.6 : 1;\nsrc/events/base.js:210:    } else b.breathScale = 1;\nsrc/events/base.js:308:      v.breath = this.breathOn ? { size: lane.breath.size, growing: lane.breath.growing, inSync: lane.breath.inSync }\nsrc/events/base.js:344:      d.rig.loop(i % 2 ? 'breathe' : 'idle');\n38:  breathe(lane) {\n39:    if