1 / 31 / 22\ncairn T3 {\"noBreath\":true} 1.25 / 1.38 / 2.00 form 16 / 17 / 22\nplank T1 {} 88 / 71 / 68 form 90 / 70 / 67\nplank T2 {} 77 / 71 / 67 form 93 / 88 / 82\nplank T3 {} 69 / 67 / 54 form 90 / 85 / 66\ngrandHold T1 {} 97 / 90 / 60 form 99 / 96 / 84\nhub-README.md issues.md plan-figures.txt \n76 logged in notes/issues.md as they happened: 64 caught by test scripts, measurements and screenshots, 12 found by reading code paths and by checking the build line by line against the plan.\nlows to debate, review, judge or audit. Ran: node tools/test.mjs with nine groups and about 2,440 checks: whole-game playthrough by bots on a stubbed pad, every event and tier, balance tables over thr\nJudging feel with no player. Scripts can prove an event is winnable, losable and separates skill levels, but not that it is fun. Bots also agreed too easily until I gave them human faults. Calibrating them was harder than I expected too: a few hundredths of a second of reaction decides whether a bot looks skilled or collapses.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6048a4b4-78b7-4200-a8b0-b745f5bb937e","uuid":"a491103a-4432-41d5-ba31-8fe6d2ad10ee","timestamp":"2026-11-05T19:35:32.508Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"build 0\nfree GB at start: 4\nbefore 999f0b4e74024aeb\nexit 1\nafter  999f0b4e74024aeb\nunit     1272 passed, 0 failed\nflow     93 passed, 0 failed\nevents   296 passed, 0 failed\nFAIL On keys: Poses T1 sharp: 88, plan 98 within 5\nFAIL On keys: Poses T2 sharp: 69, plan 86 within 14\nbalance  150 passed, 2 failed\nplan     351 passed, 0 failed\ninput    44 passed, 0 failed\naudio    175 passed, 0 failed\nhub      9 passed, 0 failed\nui       68 passed, 0 failed\n2458 passed, 2 failed\n\n[exited with code 0]\n---\nraft 1 t=131 form 70 1 rounds won of 3\nraft 2 t=92 form 100 2 rounds won of 2\nraft 3 t=119 form 70 1 rounds won of 3\non keys Poses T1 88 / 80 / 67 plan 98 / 62 / 54\non keys Poses T2 69 / 61 / 49 plan 86 / 58 / 34\non keys Still Water T1