{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkXD8hCWE2LL1bQaqEBP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This list is finite and specific, and I did name a route to it, so I'll make one last targeted pass at exactly these five. My earlier stopping point left \"real gap\" as a judgement call, so I'm making the bar explicit: **the plan's figure must fall within the range of runs the build actually produces.** That's the same test that cleared the other figures, and it's a principled place to finish.\n\nThe approaches, none of which touch the game:\n- **Keys:** my key-holding bot uses one precision for every skill, but section 3's person-like bot would surely be sloppier as skill drops, so I'll add that as a setting.\n- **Plates on keys, sharp:** first I'll find the ceiling with a perfect tapper, to see whether the limit is the bot's strategy or the input path. If it's the input path, that would be a real finding.\n- **Room Service, unbraced:** these figures come from a run with no brace, so they get their own fit."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4997,"cache_read_input_tokens":792479,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4997},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6048a4b4-78b7-4200-a8b0-b745f5bb937e","uuid":"3ee3e15f-ba6d-465e-bbe2-31b8a3e437bd","timestamp":"2026-11-05T21:52:05.763Z","request_id":"req_011CgkXD8JdaobFCWZDEZEtB"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkXD8hCWE2LL1bQaqEBP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Cuecobqz1wEwMAmqfpo96x","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='tools/fit-bots.mjs'; s=open(p).read()\nold=\"\"\"    const i = g.input, dx = ax - i.ringX, dz = az - i.ringZ;\n    key('KeyD', dx > 0.05); key('KeyA', dx < -0.05); key('KeyS', dz > 0.05); key('KeyW', dz < -0.05);\"\"\"\nnew=\"\"\"    const i = g.input, dx = ax - i.ringX, dz = az - i.ringZ, band = (o.fit && o.fit.band) || 0.05;\n    key('KeyD', dx > band); key('KeyA', dx < -band); key('KeyS', dz > band); key('KeyW', dz < -band);\"\"\"\nassert old in s; s=s.replace(old,new); open(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\nsed -n \"$(grep -n '  drive(lane' src/events/plates.js | cut -d: -f1),+30p\" src/events/plates.js | cut -c1-150; mkdir -p notes/scratch && cat > notes/scratch/plates.mjs <<'EOF'\nimport { launch, logicPage } from '../../tools/lib.mjs';\nconst b = await launch(); const p = await logicPage(b);\nconst run = (o) => p.evaluate((o) => {\n  const T = window.__TEST__;\n  T.setSeed(o.seed); T.startEvent('plates', o.tier, {});\n  const ev = T.game.currentEvent, l = ev.lanes[0];\n  const tap = (k) => { window.dispatchEvent(new KeyboardEvent('keydown', { code: k, key: k })); window.dispatchEvent(new KeyboardEvent('keyup', { code: k, key: k })); };\n  const R = { L: 1.35, M: 2.3, S: 3.2 };\n  let next = 0.1, side = 'KeyA', t = 0, target = null, wait = 0, inBand = 0, moving = 0, crashSizes = {}, prevC = 0;\n  while (!ev.isDone() && t < 70) {\n    wait -= 1 / 120;\n    if (wait <= 0) {\n      wait = o.react;\n      const on = l.plates.filter((q) => q.state === 'on');\n      const low = on.slice().sort((a, c) => a.energy - c.energy)[0];\n      const was = target;\n      if (!target || target.state !== 'on' || target.energy > o.full || (low && low.energy < o.alarm)) target = low;\n      if (target && target !== was) next = Math.min(next, 1 / R[target.size]);\n    }\n    next -= 1 / 120;\n    if (next <= 0) { tap(side); side = side === 'KeyA' ? 'KeyD' : 'KeyA'; next = 1 / R[target ? target.size : 'M']; }\n    T.advance(1 / 120); t += 1 / 120;\n    if (target && l.hoop >= target.band.lo && l.hoop <= target.band.hi) inBand += 1 / 120; else moving += 1 / 120;\n    if (l.crashes !== prevC) { prevC = l.crashes; const off = l.plates.find((q) => q.state === 'off' && q.back > 5.9); if (off) crashSizes[off.size] = (crashSizes[off.size] || 0) + 1; }\n  }\n  const o2 = { share: +(100 * ev.laneResult(l).raw).toFixed(0), crashes: l.crashes, inBand: +inBand.toFixed(0), moving: +moving.toFixed(0), crashSizes };\n  T.goto('menu');\n  return o2;\n}, o);\nfor (const [full, alarm, react] of [[0.75, 0.15, 0.12], [0.95, 0.1, 0.06], [0.98, 0.05, 0.03], [0.9, 0.25, 0.06], [0.85, 0.35, 0.06], [0.7, 0.35, 0.03], [0.6, 0.45, 0.03]]) {\n  const r = [];\n  for (const tier of [0, 1, 2]) { const v = []; for (const seed of [1, 2]) v.push(await run({ tier, seed, full, alarm, react })); r.push(`${v.map((x) => x.share).join(',')} c${v[0].crashes} ${JSON.stringify(v[0].crashSizes)} band ${v[0].inBand}/${v[0].moving}`); }\n  console.log(`perfect tapper full ${full} alarm ${alarm} react ${react} | ${r.join(' | ')}`);\n}\nawait b.close();\nEOF\nfor i in $(seq 1 60); do a=$(awk '/MemAvailable/{print int($2/1048576)}' /proc/meminfo); [ \"$a\" -ge 2 ] && break; sleep 10; done; timeout 200 node notes/scratch/plates.mjs 2>&1 | cut -c1-215","description":"Find the ceiling for a perfect tapper on Plate Spinners","timeout":500000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4997,"cache_read_input_tokens":792479,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4997},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"conte